%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/components/chat-content/chat-content-base.component.ts:1；packages/message/src/lib/services/toolbar-command/commands/bookmark.command.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员对一条或多条消息点「收藏」，之后能在书签抽屉里找回
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=implemented；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: createBookmark(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeReadResult("im_bookmark_create", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_bookmark_create", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_bookmark_create", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 收藏消息为书签 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /post/bookmark/create
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>IM: 按 affectedCount/countDelta 更新内存书签计数；无本地书签落库
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit im:read:result（请求关联结果）
  Sink-->>Gate: im:__bus__ 按 req_id 或 requestId 结算等待者
  Gate-->>UI: render absolute snapshot or query result
  Note over IM,Gate: HTTP或信封失败经 im:read:result.error 关联回灌；业务失败由结果 body 保留，不伪造成功
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：仅向 session.currentUserId 在该 account/team + channelId 下的私有书签集合追加合法 postIds；以 (account/team,userId,channelId,postId) 幂等，重复收藏后集合长度不变；Port 返回 status:'SUCCESS'；书签是 persona-local：同频道其他用户的书签集合、数量和排序全部零变化，且对端 events 为 []
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：目标固定 fail closed：请求体出现 userId 必须结构化拒绝；actor 只能由 Go session.currentUserId 注入；纯写不 emit：本次调用期间 events 长度恒为 0（不得产生 postUpdated / channelUpdate）
  Note over E,Sink: 结果出口：im:read:result；读结果与业务广播区分，不能把无广播理解为无 Effect::Emit
